1a1:T58c,Kurdish names are reflections of a deep-rooted history, a life intertwined with nature, and a rich literature. Today, modern parents tend to give their children names that reflect their cultural identity and appeal to the aesthetic perception of the modern world. In this guide, we will explore the trends of 2026 and the deep meanings of modern Kurdish names.\n\n## The Rise of Kurdish Names in the Modern Era\n\nIn the last decade, a search for modern aesthetics has been observed in the use of Kurdish names. While names representing religious or tribal ties were more popular in the past, today names based on **nature, art, freedom, and universal values** come to the fore. Modern Kurdish names are generally selected from words that are easy to pronounce, melodic to the ear, and have a deep philosophy.\n\n### Why are Modern Kurdish Names Preferred?\n\n1.  **Cultural Heritage:** New generation parents want to keep their language and culture alive in their children's names.\n2.  **Originality:** Rather than classic names, unique and rarely heard names emphasize the child's individuality.\n3.  **Phonetic Aesthetics:** Kurdish has a language structure very suitable for modern tones, especially with the use of letters like "j", "ş", "v", and "z".\n\n[Full English translation coming soon...]\n\n---\n\n> **Editor's Note:** For more names and detailed meanings, you can use our [Name Finder](/en/finder) tool.5:["$","$L1a0",null,{"formats":"$undefined","locale":"en","messages":{"brand_names":"KurdishName","seo_home_title":"Kurdish Names Meaning & Culture Encyclopedia (10,000+ Names) - KurdishName.com","seo_home_description":"Discover the most comprehensive archive of over 10,000 Kurdish names. Explore detailed meanings, historical origins, etymology, and modern baby name guides.","site_title":"KurdishName | En Kapsamlı Kürtçe İsimler Arşivi","nav_home":"Home","nav_girls":"Kurdish Girl Names","nav_boys":"Kurdish Boy Names","nav_blog":"Blog","nav_finder":"Kurdish Name Finder","featured_girl_name":"Kurdish Girl Name of the Day","featured_boy_name":"Kurdish Boy Name of the Day","search_results_title_tag":"\"{q}\" Search Results – KurdishName","search_results_header":"Search: \"{q}\"","names_found_count":"names found.","back_to_home":"Back to Home","search_no_results":"No results found.","search_try_again_hint":"Please try again with a different word.","theme_toggle":"Dark mode","loading_new_names":"Loading new names...","letter_no_results":"No names found matching criteria for this letter.","search_btn_text":"Search","random_name_discover_title":"Discover random name","popular_searches":"Popular:","aria_alphabet_letter_label":"Names starting with letter {letter}","aria_view_girls_label":"See girl names","aria_view_boys_label":"See boy names","share_btn":"Copy link","similar_names":"Similar Names","random":"Random","origin_Kurdish_Crossover":"Kurdish-Crossover","home_title":"Kurdish Names Archive","home_h1_title":"The Most Comprehensive Kurdish Name Archive","home_desc":"Discover Kurdish boy and girl names along with their meanings, origins, and similar name suggestions.","home_badge":"2026 Modern Kurdish Names","home_total":"Total","home_female":"Girls","home_male":"Boys","home_btn_boys":"Kurdish Boy Names","home_btn_finder":"Kurdish Name Finder","home_random_girls":"Random Kurdish Girl Names","home_random_boys":"Random Kurdish Boy Names","home_categories":"Kurdish Name Categories","footer_copy":"© 2026 KurdishName - kurdishname.com","footer_privacy":"Privacy Policy","footer_terms":"Terms of Use","footer_cookies":"Cookie Policy","footer_contact":"Contact","footer_about":"About Us","sidebar_boys":"Kurdish Boy Names","sidebar_girls":"Kurdish Girl Names","sidebar_letters":"Kurdish Names by Letter","sidebar_view_all":"View All ({gender})","cat_title_kiz":"Kurdish Girl Names","cat_title_erkek":"Kurdish Boy Names","cat_title_letter":"Kurdish Names Starting with {letter}","cat_desc_kiz":"Explore the most beautiful, modern, and meaningful Kurdish baby girl names. Discover their origins, deep definitions, and phonetic guides!","cat_desc_erkek":"Discover traditional, strong, and contemporary Kurdish baby boy names. Search names with comprehensive meanings, roots, and pronunciation!","category_girls_title":"Kurdish Girl Names","category_boys_title":"Kurdish Boy Names","category_girls_description":"Explore the most beautiful, modern, and meaningful Kurdish baby girl names. Discover their origins, deep definitions, and phonetic guides!","category_boys_description":"Discover traditional, strong, and contemporary Kurdish baby boy names. Search names with comprehensive meanings, roots, and pronunciation!","cat_intro_kiz":"A curated collection of beautiful, meaningful, and popular Kurdish baby girl names.","cat_intro_erkek":"A curated collection of strong, noble, and traditional Kurdish baby boy names.","cat_desc_letter":"Browse all Kurdish names starting with the letter {letter} in alphabetical order. Click to explore meanings, origins, and cultural insights!","detail_meaning":"Meaning","detail_origin":"Origin","detail_gender":"Gender","detail_letter":"Letter","detail_related":"Related Names","detail_view_all":"View All {gender} Names","finder_title":"Kurdish Name Finder","finder_seo_desc":"Smart filtering tool to find Kurdish names. Search baby names by gender, theme, and starting letter.","finder_step1":"Step 1: Select Gender","finder_step2":"Step 2: Theme (Optional)","finder_step3":"Step 3: Starting Letter (Optional)","finder_back":"Back","finder_finish":"See Names ({count})","finder_empty":"No names found matching your criteria. Please relax your filters.","finder_result_title":"Selected Names For You","finder_try_again":"Start Over","finder_diff_matter":"Doesn't Matter","blog_title":"Kurdish Names Blog","blog_read_more":"Read More","blog1_title":"Kurdish Girl Names and Meanings (Most Beautiful and Unique)","blog1_desc":"Discover the most beautiful, modern, and unique Kurdish girl names and their meanings. A great guide to inspire you when choosing a baby name.","blog1_content":"Kurdish culture, with its rich history and language, offers very naive, poetic, and deeply meaningful names for girls. If you are looking for Kurdish girl names for your newborn baby, you are in the right place. We have compiled the most beautiful, popular, and unique Kurdish girl names for you, from traditional to modern.\\n\\n...","blog2_title":"Kurdish Boy Names and Meanings (Comprehensive List)","blog2_desc":"The most popular, modern, and noble Kurdish boy names. A carefully prepared list of the most current Kurdish boy names for expecting parents.","blog2_content":"Kurdish has many boy names referring to epics, nature, strength, and wisdom. Kurdish boy names stand out with their deep meanings and emphatic sound structures. The name given to your son will undoubtedly be a noble mark he will carry throughout his life.\\n\\n...","blog3_title":"Most Beautiful Kurdish Girl Names and List","blog3_desc":"A guide for Kurdish girl names featuring popular, unique, religious, and modern options. Great Kurdish name suggestions for expecting families.","blog3_content":"Are you looking for unique and deeply meaningful Kurdish girl names for your baby girl? Kurdish culture, with its deep-rooted structure, literature, and language, offers wonderful naming options. We discuss the concept of Kurdish girl names, which parents have shown great interest in recently, along with their meanings.\\n\\n...","admin_login_title":"Admin Panel","admin_login_desc":"Login to the control panel","admin_username":"Username","admin_password":"Password","admin_login_btn":"Login","admin_invalid_creds":"Invalid username or password","admin_menu_dashboard":"Dashboard","admin_menu_names":"Name List","admin_menu_settings":"Site Settings","admin_menu_logout":"Logout","admin_menu_goto_site":"Go to Site","admin_dash_title":"Dashboard Summary","admin_dash_total":"Total Names","admin_dash_girls":"Girl Names","admin_dash_boys":"Boy Names","admin_dash_multilang":"Multi-language Support","admin_dash_lang_dist":"Language Distribution","admin_dash_db_ready":"Database Ready Architecture","admin_dash_db_desc":"Current lists simulate temporary CRUD operations via localStorage. For real environments, simply connect a backend like Firebase or PostgreSQL.","admin_names_title":"Name List","admin_names_add":"Add New Name","admin_names_search":"Search name...","admin_names_all_genders":"All Genders","admin_names_female":"Girl","admin_names_male":"Boy","admin_names_both":"Unisex","admin_names_col_name":"Name","admin_names_col_meaning":"Meaning","admin_names_col_gender":"Gender","admin_names_col_actions":"Actions","admin_names_confirm_delete":"Are you sure you want to delete this name?","admin_names_empty":"No records found.","admin_names_limit":"Displayed list is limited to 50 records. Total: {count}","admin_settings_title":"Site Settings","admin_settings_save":"Save Settings","admin_settings_saved":"Saved","admin_settings_seo_tr":"General SEO & Title (Turkish)","admin_settings_seo_en":"General SEO & Title (English)","admin_settings_site_title":"Site Title","admin_settings_site_desc":"Meta Description","admin_settings_sys":"System Settings","admin_settings_maint":"Maintenance Mode (Site closed to visitors)","gender_female":"Girl","gender_male":"Boy","gender_both":"Unisex","gender_unisex":"Unisex","not_found":"Name Not Found","default_origin":"Kurdish","no_meaning":"The meaning of this name has not yet been added. However, it holds a significant place in Kurdish cultural heritage.","seo_keywords_names":"meaning of the name {name}, Kurdish names, Kurdish {genderText} names","seo_name_title":"What Does {name} Mean in Kurdish? {name} Name Meaning & Origin","detail_meaning_rich":"What Does {name} Mean? Meaning of the Name {name}","detail_origin_rich":"Origin of the Name {name} - Kurdish Baby Names & Etymology","detail_gender_rich":"Gender and Cultural Analysis of the Name {name}","detail_gender_desc":"The name {name} is categorized under modern Kurdish {genderText} names. Primarily chosen for {genderText} babies, the name {name} stands out as one of the most popular and elegant choices among Kurdish baby names due to its beautiful meaning and phonetics.","detail_similar_rich":"Modern Kurdish {genderText} Names Similar to {name}","seo_blog_keywords":"Kurdish names, baby names, blog","seo_blog_desc":"The most comprehensive blog and expert guides on choosing Kurdish names, cultural origins, modern baby names, and language etymology.","theme_nature":"Nature, Tree, Flower","theme_power":"Power, Courage, Heroism","theme_beauty":"Love, Beauty, Delicate","theme_light":"Sun, Light, Brightness","theme_wisdom":"Wisdom, Mind, Success","theme_mixed":"Mixed (Doesn't Matter)","cat_all_themes":"All Themes","search_placeholder":"Search among 10.000+ names...","trends_title":"Weekly Trends & Popular Names","trends_desc":"The most favorited and explored Kurdish baby names this week.","trends_live":"LIVE","suggest":"suggest-name","suggest_badge":"ARCHIVE EXPANDER","suggest_title":"Suggest a New Name","suggest_seo_title":"Suggest a New Kurdish Name","suggest_seo_desc":"Submit Kurdish names not yet listed in our archive with their meanings and gender details, let's grow the database together.","suggest_desc":"Share Kurdish names not yet in our database. After academic verification, we will add them as soon as possible.","suggest_label_name":"Suggested Name","suggest_placeholder_name":"e.g., Arîn, Alend...","suggest_label_gender":"Gender","suggest_label_meaning":"Meaning & Notes","suggest_placeholder_meaning":"Known meaning of the name, reference book, or historical origin...","suggest_label_email":"Your Email Address (Optional)","suggest_opt_in":"Notify me when this name is added and when new updates are published.","suggest_btn_submit":"Submit Suggestion","suggest_success_title":"Suggestion Received!","suggest_success_desc":"We will academically analyze your suggested name and add it to our database once verified. Thank you for keeping the Kurdish naming heritage alive!","suggest_another":"Suggest Another Name","compare":"compare","nav_compare":"Compare","compare_seo_title":"Baby Name Comparison Tool","compare_seo_desc":"Compare your favorite Kurdish baby names side-by-side by meaning, origin, popularity, and character compatibility to make the best decision.","compare_badge":"DECISION SUPPORT ENGINE","compare_title":"Name Comparison Module","compare_desc":"Undecided? Put your two favorite Kurdish names side-by-side; compare meanings, genders, letter lengths, and phonetic harmony to make the perfect choice!","compare_label_1":"Name 1","compare_label_2":"Name 2","compare_placeholder":"Search name to compare...","compare_harmony_score":"Acoustic Harmony Index","compare_harmony_desc":"Phonetic similarity and letter structure alignment coefficient.","compare_stat_length":"Letter Count","compare_stat_meaning":"Meaning","compare_stat_origin":"Origin","compare_stat_gender":"Gender","compare_stat_popularity":"Trend Level","compare_quick_fav":"Select from Favorites:","compare_empty_title":"No Name Selected","compare_empty_desc":"Search for two names in the boxes above, or click on your favorited names to start comparing them side-by-side!","harmony_good":"Good Harmony","harmony_perfect":"Perfect Harmony!","harmony_neutral":"Compatible Structure","select_first_name":"Please select the first name","select_second_name":"Please select the second name","clear_comparison":"Clear Comparison","favorites_compare_cta_title":"Compare Your Favorite Names","favorites_compare_cta_desc":"Put your saved baby names side-by-side to review their meanings and phonetic harmony.","favorites_compare_cta_btn":"Compare Now","search_suggest_cta_title":"Didn't find the name you were looking for?","search_suggest_cta_desc":"The Kurdish name you searched for might not be in our database yet. Suggest it now, and we will add it after academic verification!","cat_theme_nature":"Nature / Life","cat_theme_power":"Courage / Power","cat_theme_beauty":"Love / Beauty","aria_search_label":"Search for names","aria_search_button":"Search","aria_lang_switch":"Switch to {lang}","aria_nav_label":"Site navigation","cat_theme_light":"Light / Brightness","cat_theme_wisdom":"Wisdom / Mind","theme_nature_title":"Kurdish Nature Names","theme_nature_desc":"The most beautiful Kurdish baby names and their meanings inspired by nature, trees, flowers, and the vitality of life.","theme_power_title":"Kurdish Power and Courage Names","theme_power_desc":"The most noble Kurdish names representing strength, courage, bravery, heroism, and dignity.","theme_beauty_title":"Kurdish Love and Beauty Names","theme_beauty_desc":"The most popular Kurdish names meaning love, beauty, elegance, grace, and tenderness.","theme_light_title":"Kurdish Light and Brightness Names","theme_light_desc":"Meaningful Kurdish baby names radiating sun, light, star, brilliance, dawn, and brightness.","theme_wisdom_title":"Kurdish Wisdom and Intellect Names","theme_wisdom_desc":"A list of Kurdish names representing wisdom, mind, intelligence, nobility, vision, and success.","theme_nature_intro":"Nature-themed Kurdish names represent one of the most deeply rooted naming traditions in Mesopotamia's thousands of years of cultural memory. These names, which capture the majesty of mountains, the clarity of rivers, and the exuberance of spring in a single word, reflect the very soul of Kurdish culture through both their phonetic beauty and their profound natural metaphors. In Kurdish, bearing the name of a tree, a flower, or a mountain stream is not merely an identity — it is a philosophy of life and a deep cultural bond passed down through generations.","theme_power_intro":"Power and courage-themed Kurdish names are emblems of an epic culture forged through the depths of history, the valor songs that echoed through the rugged mountains of Mesopotamia, and an unbreakable understanding of character. These names carry not only strength but also honor, justice, and nobility within them. Kurdish mythology and heroic epics have shaped the roots of these powerful names, with each one aimed at carrying the spirit of a hero and the resistance tradition of a people across generations.","theme_beauty_intro":"Beauty and love-themed Kurdish names were born from the most delicate images of Kurdish poetry and the ancient love stories of Mesopotamia. Woven with words like 'Evîn' (love) and 'Hêvî' (hope), these names reflect not only aesthetic beauty but also a grace and warmth that flows from the depths of the soul. In Kurdish culture, names given in honor of love have been seen as the first gateway through which a child enters the world, and the most precious gift a family can bestow upon them.","theme_light_intro":"Light-themed Kurdish names are the unique gift of a culture inspired by the sun illuminating the peaks of the Zagros mountains and the stars shining over the plains of Mesopotamia. In Kurdish literature, light is the universal metaphor for hope, knowledge, and freedom. Names such as 'Ronahî' (brightness), 'Sterk' (star), and 'Rojda' (sunrise) mean more than just giving a child a name — they are a wish for a bright future and a luminous destiny.","ctx_share_text":"Check out this site!","ctx_share":"Share Name","ctx_copy":"Copy","ctx_home":"Back to Home","spelling_arabic":"Arabic Alphabet (Sorani/Kurmanji)","spelling_latin":"Latin Alphabet","spelling_cyrillic":"Cyrillic Alphabet","spelling_etymology":"Etymology and Cultural Roots","brand_prefix":"Kurdish Names","finder_step_gender":"Gender","finder_step_theme":"Theme","finder_step_letter":"Letter","finder_step_results":"Results","finder_analyzing":"Analyzing names...","finder_intro_title":"Ready to Find a Name?","finder_intro_desc":"Discover the most meaningful Kurdish names step by step with our smart algorithm.","finder_step":"Step","finder_empty_hint":"You can try again by changing your filter details.","about_title":"About Us","about_seo_desc":"Learn about KurdishName, our mission, vision, and the purpose behind the world's most comprehensive Kurdish name archive.","about_vision_title":"Our Mission & Vision","about_vision_p":"KurdishName was established to preserve, document, and accurately pass on names — the most valuable part of cultural heritage — to future generations. As the world's most comprehensive 4-language Kurdish name library, we handle the etymological origin, cultural meaning, and phonetic structure of each name to academic standards.","about_archive_title":"Comprehensive Name Archive","about_archive_p":"Our database contains over 10,000 unique names compiled from Kurdish dialects such as Kurmanji, Sorani, Zazaki, and Kelhuri. We present to our users the ancient themes behind each name — such as nature, wisdom, love, and nobility — through a modern interface.","about_trans_title":"Multilingual & Reliable Guide","about_trans_p":"KurdishName offers fully synchronized support in Turkish, English, German, and Arabic. Our goal is to provide globally standardized, unbiased, and scientific guidance to parents who — wherever in the world they may be — want to give their baby a name that carries a meaningful and cultural connection.","about_feedback_title":"Contribution & Feedback","about_feedback_p":"Etymology and language studies are a constantly evolving field. If you would like to suggest new names to our archive or contribute to the meanings of existing names, you can always contact us through our Contact page or directly via email.","contact_email_label":"Email:","privacy_title":"Privacy Principles","privacy_seo_desc":"KurdishName privacy principles, data protection standards, and privacy statement.","privacy_h1":"Data Collection","privacy_p1":"User privacy is the highest priority for KurdishName. Our platform absolutely does not store users' search history or personal preferences in an identifiable manner.","privacy_h2":"Cookies","privacy_p2":"Standard cookies may be used to enhance the user experience and perform web traffic analysis. All data collected through these cookies is completely anonymous.","privacy_h3":"Third Parties","privacy_p3":"No anonymous analytical data collected on our site is shared with third parties or institutions for commercial or advertising purposes.","privacy_h4":"Security","privacy_p4":"Our website is protected by an SSL encryption certificate, and all your usage experiences are under the assurance of KurdishName.","privacy_h5":"Contact","privacy_p5":"For any questions regarding our privacy principles and data security, you can always contact us at info@kurdishname.com.","terms_title":"Terms of Use","terms_seo_desc":"KurdishName terms of use, copyright, intellectual property protection, and legal liability disclaimer.","terms_h1":"Terms of Service and Acceptance","terms_p1":"By accessing and using the KurdishName platform, you accept these terms of use in advance. If you do not approve of these terms, please do not use our site.","terms_h2":"Copyright and Intellectual Property","terms_p2":"All intellectual property rights to name lists, blog posts, original designs, and content on the site belong to KurdishName. Unauthorized copying, reproduction, or commercial use of the contents is strictly prohibited.","terms_h3":"Important Notice and Disclaimer","terms_p3":"Name meanings, origins, and cultural analyses provided on the KurdishName platform are for informational purposes only.\n\n1. Accuracy Guarantee: Although our data is meticulously reviewed, no guarantee is given regarding the 100% accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of the information.\n\n2. Personal Decisions: The decision to choose a name for your baby or use this information in official documents is entirely the user's responsibility.\n\n3. Legal Exemption: The KurdishName platform cannot be held responsible for any material, moral, or legal disputes that may arise from the meanings, origins, or pronunciation of names. By using our site, you are deemed to have accepted these terms in advance.","terms_h4":"Right to Make Changes","terms_p4":"KurdishName reserves the right to update, modify, or renew these terms of use at any time without prior notice.","cookies_title":"Cookie Policy","cookies_seo_desc":"KurdishName cookie policy, cookie usage, and preference management instructions.","cookies_h1":"What is a Cookie?","cookies_p1":"Cookies are small text files saved to your computer or mobile device by the websites you visit. They ensure websites work efficiently and improve user experience.","cookies_h2":"How Do We Use Cookies?","cookies_p2":"KurdishName uses anonymous analytical cookies and functional cookies primarily to perform statistical analyses, track traffic, and remember your in-site language preferences (TR, EN, etc.). We absolutely do not use unauthorized cookies for advertising purposes.","cookies_h3":"Managing Cookies","cookies_p3":"By changing your browser settings, you can control, delete, or block cookies as you wish. For more information, please consult the 'Help' menu of your browser.","contact_title":"Contact","contact_seo_desc":"Get in touch with KurdishName for any questions, suggestions, feedback, or name submissions.","contact_desc":"You can use the form below or email us directly for your suggestions, feedback, or complaints.","contact_name":"Full Name","contact_name_ph":"Enter your full name","contact_email":"Email Address","contact_email_ph":"Enter your email address","contact_msg":"Your Message","contact_msg_ph":"Type your message here...","contact_submit":"Send Message","contact_success":"Your message has been sent successfully. We will get back to you as soon as possible.","total_names":"TOTAL NAMES","boy_names":"KURDISH BOY NAMES","girl_names":"KURDISH GIRL NAMES","home_description":"A collection of 10.000+ names derived from Kurmanji and other Kurdish dialects. With their meanings, origins, and gender information.","name_description_template":"What does the Kurdish name {name} mean? Discover the origin, meaning, pronunciation, and gender analysis of the name {name} as a {gender} name in our comprehensive Kurdish baby names dictionary.","origin_Kürtçe":"Kurdish","origin_Farsça":"Persian","origin_Arapça":"Arabic","origin_İbranice":"Hebrew","origin_Sanskritçe":"Sanskrit","origin_Latince":"Latin","origin_Yunanca":"Greek","tags":"Tags","alphabetical_index":"Kurdish Alphabetical Index","contents":"Contents","origin_Kürtçe_Farsça":"Kurdish, Persian","origin_Kürtçe_Arapça":"Kurdish, Arabic","origin_Farsça_Kürtçe":"Persian, Kurdish","origin_İbranice_Arapça":"Hebrew, Arabic","not_found_title":"404 - Page Not Found","not_found_heading":"The page you are looking for might have been lost in the dusty shelves.","not_found_text":"The page might have been moved, deleted, or never existed. You can continue exploring new names by returning to the home page.","home_latest_blog":"Latest Guides & Blog Posts","home_latest_blog_desc":"Explore our expert guides, cultural stories, and tips on choosing the perfect name for your baby.","home_view_all_blog":"View All Posts","home_read_more":"Read More","blog4_content":"$1a1","nav_favorites":"My Favorites","favorites_title":"My Favorites","favorites_subtitle":"Your Private Selection Book","favorites_seo_desc":"Your private name book where you save Kurdish names you like. A custom favorite names list for yourself or loved ones.","favorites_empty":"Your book is empty. Click on the heart (♥) button next to names to save names you like and build your own custom book!","favorites_clear_all":"Clear All","favorites_add":"Add to Book","favorites_remove":"Remove from Book","favorites_count":"There is {count} name saved in your book.","favorites_count_plural":"There are {count} names saved in your book.","whatsapp_share_btn":"Send to Spouse/Family on WhatsApp","whatsapp_share_msg":"I checked out the name {name} in KurdishName. Meaning: {meaning}. What do you think?","download_card_btn":"Download Name Card (Instagram / WhatsApp)","seo_link_girls_names":"kurdish girl names","seo_link_boys_names":"kurdish boy names","seo_link_baby_names":"kurdish baby names","seo_link_name_finder":"kurdish name finder","name_breadcrumb_suffix":"Kurdish Name","blog_silo_prefix":"Discover all meanings, origins, and etymology indexes inside our comprehensive list of ","blog_silo_suffix":". Comparison modules and advanced finder tools are synchronized.","name_silo_prefix":"If you are looking for a meaningful name for your baby, discover more ","name_silo_suffix":" in our comprehensive directory, comparing origins and definitions side-by-side."},"now":"$undefined","timeZone":"Europe/Istanbul","children":"$L1a2"}]
